{"sourceUrl":"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/uxdwicDOtOJYYL38cqemqg","status":"full","attemptedAt":"2026-11-15T16:50:26.286398+00:00","httpStatus":200,"fetchedUrl":"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/uxdwicDOtOJYYL38cqemqg","html":"<div><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_gif/iadGcHegc7t1oCcnW18WtpxpWlM6KT50hOfzemwRf3EW1GGcsYibLjibaUbmzCjv959CZ0k99Q966jnFKnHerS4J9GErTQic7dXj3mKyPicslVbw/640?wx_fmt=gif&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/iadGcHegc7t2osKbz7DbFicSpb6ic8Q80xftERrIL4vZ8TEjYFYgeBslNU9Al0RXwiaDm2DQSYCyG5UKnO98Dlmy9YOtwvQ3yrqxjd7sEmHjLc4/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/iadGcHegc7t2w0EY17GcsJwmUpDfKouua3AyBSUEtY3ibic3Y8Ff0OlDgDVQ5I49DFEeOfS8EOibpnSRNnAFZCicvhsN68VtGMeYdvaYCV0UbLc0/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>01</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><strong><span>历史沿革</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/iadGcHegc7t35hvL4ZiaduoHKxibZ6NQWEcVNAgAAqWiaI5wXycce5SxB1rRiaQDVtFDPomaFHBPYK6vzwZXSY98hGh9XwOyreIaiaiaBZ0niaqeiaPE/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>02</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><strong><span>学院概况</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><span>学院以“总体国家安全观”为引领，聚焦国家重大安全战略需求，秉承学校“双一流”建设部署，培养安全领域多学科交叉创新领军人才。学院下设安全工程系、防护工程系、应急保障系、关键基础设施韧性防护研究中心等</span><span><em><strong><span>4</span></strong></em></span><span>个内设机构。</span></p></section></section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/iadGcHegc7t3SIR0tRVQUK40pdmUCxawv2S9FZsXRUxD6nMicV33tIywUQJIPQj8dslRJWMdicLzXiaGzEOicic6JuRkBAdFPEic4CaVcBc6oPI8S4/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section><section><p><span><span>▲6位院士共同为学院成立揭牌</span></span></p></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>03</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><strong><span>学科优势</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><span>瞄准国际安全科技与防护工程前沿，紧扣国防安全、人民防空与国民经济安全领域重大战略需求，深化安全科学与工程、兵器科学与技术、计算机科学与技术、仪器科学与技术以及土木工程等多学科交叉融合建设，统筹推进“学科-学位点-专业”一体化改革，形成了</span><span><strong><span>本硕博一体贯通培养和安全-防护-应急交叉融合发展</span></strong></span><span>特色布局。</span></p><p><span>学院具有</span><span><strong><span>安全科学与工程一级学科博士学位点和土木工程一级学科硕士学位点</span></strong></span><span>，安全科学与工程学科为江苏省重点学科。安全科学与工程学科源于哈军工时期的火炸药安全以及工程爆炸防护，1991年和1996年获批兵器安全技术硕士点和博士点，1998年申报并获批设立安全工程本科专业，1999年招收第一届本科生，2003年获批“安全技术及工程”（后升为一级学科“安全科学与工程”）学术型硕士学位授予权,2006年获批“安全工程”专业型硕士学位授予权，2024年获批“安全科学与工程”一级学科博士学位授予权。土木工程学科创建于1999年，2003年获批“结构工程”（后升为一级学科“土木工程”）学术型硕士学位授予权，2005年获批“建筑与土木工程”专业型硕士学位授予权。</span></p><p><span>多学科交叉融合发展，形成了含能物质安全理论与技术、工程安全与防护、应急保障技术与智能装备、智能感知与灾害预警技术等特色二级学科。</span></p></section></section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/iadGcHegc7t17sohiaJrP8MEEHFGB5Natn4l1nGIYau9iagqNnMjHyr5nvJ6V3arp0mHIoXac1icNicxG9OBxlHnicDSzDBfcibJfpZ9icrnNfP1anI/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>04</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><strong><span>学院规模</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><span>学院现有教职员工</span><strong><em><span><span>86</span></span></em></strong><span>人，其中专任教师</span><strong><em><span><span>64</span></span></em></strong><span>人（其中高级职称</span><strong><em><span><span>55</span></span></em></strong><span>人），博士后</span><strong><em><span><span>14</span></span></em></strong><span>人，博士生导师</span><strong><em><span><span>25</span></span></em></strong><span>人（含校外导师</span><strong><em><span><span>4</span></span></em></strong><span>人），硕士生导师</span><strong><em><span><span>31</span></span></em></strong><span>人。教师队伍中含中国工程院院士</span><strong><em><span><span>1</span></span></em></strong><span>人，国家级青年人才</span><strong><em><span><span>6</span></span></em></strong><span>人，且拥有何勇教授领衔的“全国高校黄大年式教师团队”、卞雷祥教授领衔的“关键基础设施韧性防护”科技创新团队等，持续赋能有组织教学科研体系构建。</span></p></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>05</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><strong><span>科学研究</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><span>学院近五年已承担国家重点研发计划项目课题、工信部国家科技重大专项等重点项目</span><strong><em><span><span>70</span></span></em></strong><span>余项，承担其他各类科研项目及课题</span><strong><em><span><span>1</span></span></em></strong><strong><em><span><span>00</span></span></em></strong><span>余项，年均科研到账经费超过</span><strong><em><span><span>1</span></span></em></strong><span>亿。参与制定国家标准</span><strong><em><span><span>7</span></span></em></strong><span>项，其中牵头制定国家标准</span><strong><em><span><span>2</span></span></em></strong><span>项。在国内外高水平期刊发表学术论文</span><strong><em><span><span>80</span></span></em></strong><strong><em><span><span>0</span></span></em></strong><span>余篇，授权发明专利</span><strong><em><span><span>90</span></span></em></strong><span>余项。相关成果获得国家科技进步二等奖</span><strong><em><span><span>1</span></span></em></strong><span>项、省部级科学技术奖励</span><strong><em><span><span>7</span></span></em></strong><span>项、学会/协会科学技术奖励</span><strong><em><span><span>8</span></span></em></strong><span>项。</span></p></section></section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/iadGcHegc7t1icfBBnRAoh2TUv3kibBUCkWSUyQyvDnEB2qkG3OtUn7XS2oIMUL0ql0R3fVCib0kvJJGzCHJxswlf2JN149qBgTOcic7tSeyfupI/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>06</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><strong><span>招生专业</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/iadGcHegc7t3DPP4wV2fPR4tz16icolYEwZ4eOicHdibTQPVmNicdK8qQY3kA3HXuavrENicS8PItVzpvnoMR75jxmyDOrDOJtvOeWTQ9abcs6cV4/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>07</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><strong><span>学生培养</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><span>学院现有学生</span><strong><em><span><span>623</span></span></em></strong><span>名，其中本科生</span><strong><em><span><span>253</span></span></em></strong><span>名，硕士研究生</span><strong><em><span><span>302</span></span></em></strong><span>名，博士研究生</span><strong><em><span><span>68</span></span></em></strong><span>名。近五年，学院在学科竞赛中荣获国省级荣誉</span><strong><em><span><span>20</span></span></em></strong><span>余项，包括中国国际大学生创新大赛（2025）产业赛道金奖、中国国际大学生创新大赛（2024）国际赛道金奖、“挑战杯”人工智能+专项赛（2025）一等奖、“挑战杯”揭榜挂帅专项赛（2025）二等奖等高级别赛事奖励。</span></p></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>08</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><strong><span>对外交流</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><span>学院不断推进国际化、开放式办学，积极承办国际国内重要学术会议，在研国家自然科学基金国际合作交流项目国际合作项目</span><strong><em><span><span>3</span></span></em></strong><span>项。与日本、比利时、新加坡、西班牙、克罗地亚等国家开展项目合作，获批国合项目</span><strong><em><span><span>12</span></span></em></strong><span>项。学院学生获江苏省鲲鹏计划省政府奖学金、学校创新型人才国际合作培养项目等资助。</span></p></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>09</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><strong><span>毕业去向</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><span>学院紧扣立德树人根本任务，致力于为国家培育安全领域多学科交叉的创新领军人才，就业升学率常年保持在</span><strong><em><span><span>95%</span></span></em></strong><span>以上。就业方面，学院近年来多位毕业生在兵器工业集团、兵器装备集团、中国船舶集团、国家电网以及地市级应急管理局、公安局、高校、研究所等企事业单位任职。升学方面，学院近年来多位毕业生赴加州大学伯克利分校、悉尼大学、清华大学、同济大学、哈尔滨工业大学等国内外知名高校深造。</span></p><p><span>学院将以习近平新时代中国特色社会主义思想为引领，以“总体国家安全观”为指导，全面落实立德树人根本任务，牢记“为党育人、为国育才”使命担当，围绕“工程精英、社会中坚”人才培养定位，紧密结合国家重大安全战略需求，为国家培育安全领域多学科交叉的创新领军人才，为国家安全事业发展贡献智慧与力量！</span></p></section></section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/iadGcHegc7t1qgEtRyAX7g1Lqicnr9ANT38hYuibgn8BgNF5ngI03RogbaEkJaAicgw1BZ0ExZ6icAFGLs0pdYmUtknsOy5j4s8DSwCiapQyMjdqw/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/iadGcHegc7t0w2qLARxiaGZbma6CcyaQUWSYPL9WSsF4lRRA9l5xOvaiaPiaPe7jHbRaxLgx98VwF9jZWV977qIj8DVAH2K5BmnqjW5WCSBwy5w/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>1.</span></strong></p></section></section><section><section><p><strong><span>人数</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><span>100人左右</span></p></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>2.</span></strong></p></section></section><section><section><p><strong><span>开展形式</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><span>线上</span></p></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>3.</span></strong></p></section></section><section><section><p><strong><span>申请时间</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><span>2026年8月15日前</span></p></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>4.</span></strong></p></section></section><section><section><p><strong><span>申请条件</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><span>（1）申请人应为全国高校在校生（2027年应届毕业生），且学习成绩优异、英语水平良好（四六级成绩或其他资格考试证明）；</span></p><p><span>（2）申请人本科专业为安全、土木等相近专业，有较好的专业素养和较强的创新能力；</span></p><p><span>（3）申请人对科学研究有浓厚的兴趣，且具有较强科研工作能力；</span></p><p><span>（4）申请人具有良好的思想品德和政治素质，遵纪守法，身心健康，在校期间无违纪行为、未受过处分；</span></p></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><strong><span>5</span></strong></span><strong><span>.</span></strong></p></section></section><section><section><p><strong><span>申请程序</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><span>登录研究生院招生网站（https://gs.njust.edu.cn/zsw/）点击“校园开放日申请登录”填写报名信息。报名结束后，学院根据学科特点、开放日规模，选择一定数量学生参加开放日活动，并通过邮件方式进行通知。</span></p></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>6.</span></strong></p></section></section><section><section><p><b><span>申请材料</span></b></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><span>请将以下材料按序号整理排序，扫描后合并为一个PDF文件，要求有目录、页数和页眉，在每一页的右上角页眉处做好内容标记，方便专家查看。PDF命名方式：为“本科院校+姓名+本科专业”。该PDF文件请于</span><span><strong><span>8月15日18:00前</span></strong></span><span>发送至邮箱：yz133@njust.edu.cn，请勿重复发送。所提交的材料务必保证真实准确，若弄虚作假，一经发现，立即取消申请资格。</span></p><p><span>（1）本人居民身份证和学生证原件。</span></p><p><span>（2）现有本科阶段成绩单与专业总评成绩排名原件（须学校教务部门或学院盖章）。</span></p><p><span>（3）外语水平证明（如CET-4、CET-6、TOEFL、IELTS等的证书或成绩单）。</span></p><p><span>（4）其他材料，如校级及以上获奖证书、公开发表的学术论文、资格证书等。</span></p></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>7.</span></strong></p></section></section><section><section><p><b><span>活动日程</span></b></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/iadGcHegc7t1KsQOxicDweGK14hxUd9MlJH4IEibFIibEFETy1R4icmRk34Hxbgl9NnMD3L6OUDehAgzcrEogJ6uNAxJLz9ibxvHkqb2Bv08N6RXM/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>8.</span></strong></p></section></section><section><section><p><b><span>其他</span></b></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><span>（1）</span><span><span>7月10日有安工学院的三场宣讲，欢迎同学们关注。<a href=\"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?__biz=MzAwNjU2MjUzMw==&amp;mid=2650105310&amp;idx=1&amp;sn=115717a08919ad69ec647b93c09cf341&amp;scene=21#wechat_redirect\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">择国所需 选己所爱 | 7月3日-18日，南京理工大学2027年研究生招生线上宣讲会云端相约</a></span></span></p><p><span>（2）未能参加开放日活动的同学可关注学院后期活动。</span></p><p><span>（3）本公告由安全科学与学院（应急管理学院）招生工作领导小组负责解释。</span></p></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>9.</span></strong></p></section></section><section><section><p><b><span>联系方式</span></b></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>联系人</span></strong></p></section></section></section><section><section><p><span>张老师</span></p></section></section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>联系电话</span></strong></p></section></section></section><section><section><p><span>025-84</span><span><span>3</span></span><span>15830</span></p></section></section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>电子邮箱</span></strong></p></section></section></section><section><section><p><span>yz133@njust.edu.</span><span><span>c</span></span><span>n</span></p></section></section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/iadGcHegc7t3CmHgHjSEpOeQibn6w6eOYE6abdg8CXCNNu21DrFaEDhicbpjnxJDyajWgiaU1D5hoOX89VT06R2PStCicxV0v8xuic8cpicSTMUg0Q/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><section><section><p><span>出品丨南京理工大学研招办</span></p><p><span>来源丨安全科学与工程学院 （应急管理学院）</span></p><p><span>编辑丨吴雅琪</span></p><p><span>初审丨秦俊华 安全科学与工程学院 （应急管理学院）</span></p><p><span>审核丨于雷</span></p></section></section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/iadGcHegc7t0OQovia97aicoveowcWQRdqUlox64kJLiaVMwNWrfDLXaTccVnaZFrF2MuM4nibEBUOgH0rYd1omIpibx4R3v0xnG8vnc9vPXBicpwE/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section></section></section><p></p></div>","textSha256":"d1b3aaa7e738534f358243aeecacde07e8c341d2fe4767f255b4fa12b2a60d17","textLength":2576,"sourceSha256":"d8d2ea8771f7d4346af3b8cbf3fa5e015985304790e39f66764b12a756f088f6","selector":"#js_content","attachments":[],"pdfs":[],"unavailableMedia":[],"id":"syp-d0af78757c409aee6079","title":"2026年南京理工大学安全科学与工程学院（应急管理学院）2026年全国“优秀大学生”校园开放日活动公告","capturedAt":"2026-11-15T16:50:26.286398+00:00"}
